<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Abbott Labs raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Abbott Labs raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it upgraded Abbott Laboratories Inc to accumulate from hold.</p>
<p>-- said raised the 1997 earnings estimate to $2.74 a share from $2.70 a share and raised the 1998 estimate to $3.09 a share from $3.03 a share.</p>
<p>-- said Abbott's top line growth continues to be strong, and the company continues to exhibit solid earnings performance.</p>
<p>-- Abbott gained 5/8 to 56.</p>
</text>
